    "detailed_description": "Inspired from Prince Of Persia and Commander Keen,<br>but also ZxSpectrum &amp; Commodore 64 Games.<br>Bending the limitation of those systems but also bringing nostalgia,<br>This game is about those demons inside our own minds that hold us back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/e91e06b396b91af34e7cb890a994a670.avif?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>You arrived on the surface of a strange planet,<br>a signal directed you to investigate. Deep within a cave,<br>there is a strange artifact, you cannot move past it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/02a00d45b4486494e05c5105274f8921.poster.avif?t=1729018467\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/02a00d45b4486494e05c5105274f8921.apng?t=1729018467\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=288 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>Within the artifact, a powerful demon was imprisoned,<br>wielding super natural powers it can bring your demise,<br>if you are swift enough you can prowess and show it who you are.<br>But the demon is slick and curses you to find out of your mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/bb382ba920e077347dfd84f584258f8d.avif?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>You have to battle your own mind, your senses are distorted<br>and you will need to battle the monsters that your perception represents.<br>Only breaking free of this curse will allow you to get back to your ship and survive.<br><br>Is Your Soul Ready For This Transformation?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>The game will feature 10 levels, each with 1bit pixelart:<br>- Obelisk<br>- Cave<br>- Depths<br>- Tendrils of touch<br>- Ravenouse ravine<br>- Abyss<br>- Olfactory orchestra<br>- Blinded alcoves<br>- Gallery of gloom<br>- Repressed sanctum<br><br>Each level will introduce a new mechanic to play in tandem<br>with the Prince of Persia like platforming mechanic.<br><br>There will also be several bosses to fight,<br>more than battling the big eyed Zeze,<br>which is the main villain of the game,<br><br>you will also meet the Monster of Touch<br>Which will need swift reactions to survive it's grasp.<br><br>The Monster of Sight will require you patience and courage,<br>while also hiding in the shadows such as you don't get seen.<br><br>And many more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Inspired from Prince Of Persia and Commander Keen,<br>but also ZxSpectrum &amp; Commodore 64 Games.<br>Bending the limitation of those systems but also bringing nostalgia,<br>This game is about those demons inside our own minds that hold us back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/e91e06b396b91af34e7cb890a994a670.avif?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>You arrived on the surface of a strange planet,<br>a signal directed you to investigate. Deep within a cave,<br>there is a strange artifact, you cannot move past it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/02a00d45b4486494e05c5105274f8921.poster.avif?t=1729018467\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/02a00d45b4486494e05c5105274f8921.apng?t=1729018467\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=288 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>Within the artifact, a powerful demon was imprisoned,<br>wielding super natural powers it can bring your demise,<br>if you are swift enough you can prowess and show it who you are.<br>But the demon is slick and curses you to find out of your mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/bb382ba920e077347dfd84f584258f8d.avif?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>You have to battle your own mind, your senses are distorted<br>and you will need to battle the monsters that your perception represents.<br>Only breaking free of this curse will allow you to get back to your ship and survive.<br><br>Is Your Soul Ready For This Transformation?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span><br><br>The game will feature 10 levels, each with 1bit pixelart:<br>- Obelisk<br>- Cave<br>- Depths<br>- Tendrils of touch<br>- Ravenouse ravine<br>- Abyss<br>- Olfactory orchestra<br>- Blinded alcoves<br>- Gallery of gloom<br>- Repressed sanctum<br><br>Each level will introduce a new mechanic to play in tandem<br>with the Prince of Persia like platforming mechanic.<br><br>There will also be several bosses to fight,<br>more than battling the big eyed Zeze,<br>which is the main villain of the game,<br><br>you will also meet the Monster of Touch<br>Which will need swift reactions to survive it's grasp.<br><br>The Monster of Sight will require you patience and courage,<br>while also hiding in the shadows such as you don't get seen.<br><br>And many more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954860/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1729018467\" width=616 height=45 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Cursed to lose your mind during a planetary exploration, You only have your wits to help you through the perils of you own psyche. Playing as Jorvin the rat, with mechanics similar to &quot;Prince of Persia&quot;, defeat your demons and find peace with yourself.",
